## postgres-no-manual-transaction
eslint-snippets/fixture/postgres-2755/query-members.ts
ESLint 6:1 no-mistakes/postgres-no-manual-transaction (manualTransaction) Do not execute BEGIN, START TRANSACTION, COMMIT, or ROLLBACK through a query executor. Use withTransaction / withTransactionOptions so the owner helper owns transaction lifecycle.
